    "active": true,
    "description": "Remittance page sections, in the order they appear: hero, “Why Use OFX?”, the sign-up band, the FAQ and the final CTA. This is the shortest page in the family — its design draws no pricing, no free tools, no figures band and no Google Reviews. The OFX logo in the hero, and the two photographs beside the sign-up band, are part of the design rather than fields: they are a partner's mark and decoration drawn at a measured tilt. The faq_* and cta_* field names repeat the other pages’ names under different keys, which is what lets template-parts/faq.php and cta.php stay page-agnostic; unlike Property Cashout and Business Loan, the questions here are the site-wide “FAQs” posts. Everything is flat fields because ACF free has no Repeater — quantities are fixed by the layout, and empty entries are skipped rather than rendered blank. Leave a field empty and the design’s own copy renders instead: because the theme treats an empty value as “use the design default”, a field that ships with copy cannot be blanked from here, only replaced.",
    "show_in_rest": 0
}
